<a id="{{MakeAnchor "cli" .PackageName .Name}}"></a>
## CLI

This service is opted into CLI generation (`generate_cli = true`). The
generated entry point `New{{.GoName}}CLI(client.Client) *cobra.Command`
returns a root subcommand that the caller plugs under its own Cobra root.

The root command is `{{.ServiceKebabName}}` and groups the following
subcommands:

```
{{.ServiceKebabName}}
|-- workflow
|   |-- start     <workflow>
|   |-- execute   <workflow>
|   |-- signal    <workflow> <signal>
|   |-- query     <workflow> <query>
|   |-- cancel
|   |-- terminate
|   `-- describe
`-- schedule
    |-- create    <workflow>
    |-- pause
    |-- unpause
    |-- delete
    `-- describe
```

